$multi_text
 XSTR("The Prometheus tanker Boa's Journey lost a tylium line and is drifting while the crew patches it. Red flight and the frigate Halyard cover her for twelve minutes. Objectives. Keep the tanker alive until the crew seals the leak.", -1)
$end_multi_text
